program_text:
# Week 1
/// accumulation

## Upper A
// Pause one inch off the chest.
// Target: 3 RIR
Bench Press / 3x6 80kg / 180s / warmup: 1x8 60kg / progress: dp(2.5kg, 6, 8)
Lat Pulldown / 2x10 55kg, 1x10 45kg, 1x12+ 40kg / 90s / warmup: none / progress: lp(2.5kg) / superset: A
// No swing.
// Squeeze at the top.
// Target: 1 RIR
Bicep Curl, Cable / 2x12 20kg @8 / 60s / warmup: none / progress: sum(30, 2.5kg) / superset: A
Lateral Raise / 2x15 8kg / 60s / warmup: none / progress: lp(1kg)

## Lower A
// Brace.
// Target: 2 RIR
Squat / 3x5 100kg / 240s / warmup: none / progress: none
// Target: 2 RIR
Leg Press / 2x10 160kg / 120s / warmup: none / progress: custom() {~
  if (completedReps >= reps) { weights += 5kg }
~}
Pull Up / 2x8 0kg / warmup: none

# Week 2
/// accumulation

## Upper A
// Pause one inch off the chest.
// Target: 2 RIR
Bench Press / 3x6 82.5kg / 180s
Lat Pulldown / 2x10 57.5kg / 90s / superset: A
// Target: 1 RIR
Bicep Curl, Cable / 2x12 20kg @8 / 60s / superset: A
Lateral Raise / 2x15 8kg / 60s / progress: none

## Lower A
// Brace.
// Target: 2 RIR
Squat / 3x5 102.5kg / 240s
// Target: 2 RIR
Leg Press / 2x10 160kg / 120s
Pull Up / 2x8 0kg

# Week 3
/// deload

## Upper A
// Target: 4 RIR
Bench Press / 2x6 70kg / 180s / progress: none
Lat Pulldown / 2x10 45kg / 90s / progress: none / superset: A
//
Bicep Curl, Cable / 1x12 15kg @7 / 60s / progress: none / superset: A

## Lower A
// Target: 4 RIR
Squat / 2x5 85kg / 240s / progress: lp(2.5kg)
//
Leg Press / 1x10 120kg / 120s / progress: none

